{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "webhook_1",
      "provider": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "hideForm": true,
        "mode": "Source",
        "parameters": {},
        "type": "webhook"
      },
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 20, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails_in_1",
      "provider": "guardrails",
      "config": {
        "profile": "custom",
        "custom": {
          "policy_mode": "block",
          "enable_prompt_injection": true,
          "enable_content_safety": true,
          "enable_pii_detection": false,
          "enable_hallucination_check": false,
          "max_input_length": 8000,
          "max_tokens_estimate": 4000,
          "expected_format": "json",
          "blocked_topics": [],
          "allowed_topics": [
            "correlation_id",
            "event_id",
            "approved",
            "window_start",
            "window_end",
            "channel",
            "person"
          ]
        }
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "webhook_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 180, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_sense_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Stage 1 Sense: LaserData recall + FalkorDB duplicate check. No external writes.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are STAGE 1 (Sense) of Keep-One-Promise. Never book calendar. Never send messages. Never call Guild writers.",
          "Input (after guardrails): {correlation_id, event_id, approved?, window_start?, window_end?, channel?, person?}",
          "1) Preserve correlation_id forever (create UUID only if missing). Preserve approved exactly as provided (true/false/absent).",
          "2) Recall the life event from tool_laserdata_life (namespace nous:life-events) by event_id. If missing, return {\"status\":\"failed\",\"stage\":\"sense\",\"reason\":\"event_not_found\",\"correlation_id\":...} and stop.",
          "3) Confirm trigger looks like a promise (promise_made or body contains a clear promise). If not, return {\"status\":\"rejected\",\"stage\":\"sense\",\"reason\":\"not_a_promise\",\"correlation_id\":...}.",
          "4) Query FalkorDB personal_brain for an existing Commitment/proposal already DETECTED_IN or CREATED from this source_event_id/event_id. If a successful book/send Receipt already exists, return {\"status\":\"already_kept\",\"stage\":\"sense\",\"commitment_id\":...,\"correlation_id\":...} and stop (idempotent).",
          "5) If a pending Commitment exists, load it; else prepare source_event summary {event_id, person, subject, body, source, timestamp}.",
          "6) Handoff JSON ONLY to the next stage (forward approved/window fields unchanged):",
          "{\"status\":\"sensed\",\"stage\":\"sense\",\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"event_id\":\"...\",\"approved\":true|false|null,\"window_start\":\"...\",\"window_end\":\"...\",\"channel\":\"gmail|slack\",\"source_event\":{...},\"existing_commitment_id\":null|\"C-...\"}"
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "guardrails_in_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 380, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_plan_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Stage 2 Plan: calendar free/busy + commitment proposal + Guild Critic. No book/send.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are STAGE 2 (Plan) of Keep-One-Promise. READ calendar only. Never create_event. Never send email/Slack.",
          "Input is Stage 1 handoff JSON. If status is failed|rejected|already_kept, pass it through unchanged and stop.",
          "1) Determine person from source_event or input. Require window_start/window_end ISO-8601; if missing, default a 3-day window starting tomorrow and note defaults_used=true.",
          "2) Call tool_guild_calendar_reader (nous-calendar-reader) for free/busy in the window. Propose ONE free slot avoiding conflicts.",
          "3) Build approval-ready proposal:",
          "{\"commitment_id\":\"C-...\",\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"source_event_id\":\"...\",\"person\":\"...\",\"commitment\":\"visit before departure\",\"scheduled_date\":\"ISO-8601\",\"proposed_slot\":{...},\"proposed_action\":{\"connector\":\"google_calendar\",\"operation\":\"create_event\",\"parameters\":{\"title\":\"...\",\"start\":\"...\",\"duration_minutes\":...,\"description\":\"...\"}},\"message\":{\"channel\":\"gmail|slack\",\"to\":\"...\",\"text\":\"...\"},\"follow_up\":{\"due_days\":2,\"text\":\"...\"},\"requires_approval\":true}",
          "4) Persist to FalkorDB (allow_writes): (:Event)-[:CREATED]->(:Commitment), (:Commitment)-[:PROMISED_TO]->(:Contact), (:Commitment)-[:PROPOSED_ACTION]->(:Action). status=awaiting_approval. Do NOT mark booked/sent.",
          "5) Send the proposal to tool_guild_critic (nous-critic). If REJECT/accepted=false: store guild_review, set status rejected, return {\"status\":\"rejected\",\"stage\":\"plan\",\"guild_review\":{...},\"correlation_id\":...} with ZERO further writes beyond review notes.",
          "6) On critic accept: remember proposal summary in tool_laserdata_life (nous:life-events).",
          "7) Forward approved unchanged. Return JSON ONLY:",
          "{\"status\":\"awaiting_approval\",\"stage\":\"plan\",\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"event_id\":\"...\",\"approved\":true|false|null,\"commitment_id\":\"C-...\",\"proposal\":{...},\"guild_review\":{...},\"conflicts\":[...]}"
        ],
        "max_waves": 14,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "agent_sense_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 620, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails_approve_1",
      "provider": "guardrails",
      "config": {
        "profile": "custom",
        "custom": {
          "policy_mode": "block",
          "enable_prompt_injection": true,
          "enable_content_safety": true,
          "enable_pii_detection": false,
          "enable_hallucination_check": false,
          "max_input_length": 12000,
          "max_tokens_estimate": 6000,
          "expected_format": "json",
          "blocked_topics": [],
          "allowed_topics": [
            "status",
            "stage",
            "correlation_id",
            "event_id",
            "approved",
            "commitment_id",
            "proposal",
            "guild_review",
            "conflicts",
            "reason",
            "source_event",
            "existing_commitment_id",
            "channel",
            "window_start",
            "window_end"
          ]
        }
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "agent_plan_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 860, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_act_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Stage 3 Act+Prove: only after approved=true — book calendar, send message, dual receipts, verify.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are STAGE 3 (Act + Prove) of Keep-One-Promise.",
          "1) If inbound status is failed|rejected|already_kept, return it unchanged — no tools that write externally.",
          "2) If approved is not exactly true: return {\"status\":\"awaiting_approval\",\"stage\":\"act\",\"commitment_id\":...,\"correlation_id\":...,\"reason\":\"human_approval_required\"}. Do NOT call calendar writer or gmail writer.",
          "3) Load commitment + proposed_action + message + guild_review from FalkorDB by commitment_id. Never trust title/start/text from the browser — only FalkorDB proposal fields.",
          "4) Guards: critic accepted; operation google_calendar.create_event; person+start exist; no successful book Receipt yet. If book receipt exists, skip create_event and reuse external_id (idempotent).",
          "5) BOOK: tool_guild_calendar_writer (nous-calendar-writer) with trusted proposal + correlation_id + commitment_id. On failure: LaserData nous:receipts failure; return {\"status\":\"failed\",\"stage\":\"book\",...}. Never fabricate external_id. Do not mark booked.",
          "6) SEND: tool_guild_gmail_writer (nous-gmail-writer) with trusted message.to/text (or slack writer if channel=slack). On failure: publish failure receipt; leave commitment booked if calendar succeeded; return {\"status\":\"failed\",\"stage\":\"send\",...}.",
          "7) PROVE: publish success to tool_laserdata_receipts (nous:receipts); write (:Action)-[:PRODUCED]->(:Receipt) for book and send with real external ids, executed_at, provider_status; set commitment status=booked; set follow_up_due = now+2 days from proposal.follow_up.",
          "8) VERIFY: query FalkorDB/LaserData that book receipt AND send receipt exist for this commitment_id. If either missing: {\"status\":\"failed\",\"stage\":\"verify\",\"missing\":[...]}",
          "9) Return JSON ONLY:",
          "{\"status\":\"kept\",\"stage\":\"act\",\"commitment_id\":\"C-...\",\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"calendar_external_id\":\"...\",\"message_external_id\":\"...\",\"follow_up_due\":\"ISO-8601\",\"verified\":true}"
        ],
        "max_waves": 16,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "guardrails_approve_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 1100, "y": 260 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-4o-mini",
        "openai-4o-mini": { "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}" },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_sense_1" },
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_plan_1" },
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_act_1" },
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "graph_falkordb_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 620, "y": 20 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_internal_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "config": { "type": "memory_internal" },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_sense_1" },
        { "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_plan_1" },
        { "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_act_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 620, "y": 480 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_laserdata_life_1",
      "provider": "tool_laserdata_memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_laserdata_memory",
        "profile": "cloud",
        "cloud": {
          "connection_string": "${LASER_CONNECTION_STRING}",
          "namespace": "nous:life-events",
          "show_advanced": true,
          "stream": "nous",
          "allow_namespace_override": true,
          "folded": true,
          "recall_limit": 20,
          "op_timeout": 30
        }
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_sense_1" },
        { "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_plan_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 380, "y": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "graph_falkordb_1",
      "provider": "graph_falkordb",
      "config": {
        "type": "graph_falkordb",
        "host": "${FALKOR_HOST}",
        "port": 6379,
        "username": "${FALKOR_USERNAME}",
        "password": "${FALKOR_PASSWORD}",
        "tls": false,
        "graph": "personal_brain",
        "db_description": "Nous personal brain trust store across Keep-One-Promise stages: Event, Contact, Commitment, Action, Receipt. Edges CREATED, PROMISED_TO, PROPOSED_ACTION, PRODUCED, DETECTED_IN.",
        "allow_writes": true,
        "allow_execute": true,
        "max_attempts": 5,
        "max_rows": 250,
        "max_execute_rows": 25000,
        "query_timeout_ms": 30000
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_sense_1" },
        { "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_plan_1" },
        { "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_act_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 620, "y": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_calendar_reader_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-calendar-reader",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 3,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_plan_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 820, "y": 20 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_critic_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-critic",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 5,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_plan_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 820, "y": 140 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_calendar_writer_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-calendar-writer",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 3,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_act_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 1280, "y": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_gmail_writer_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-gmail-writer",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 3,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_act_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 1280, "y": 160 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_laserdata_receipts_1",
      "provider": "tool_laserdata_memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_laserdata_memory",
        "profile": "cloud",
        "cloud": {
          "connection_string": "${LASER_CONNECTION_STRING}",
          "namespace": "nous:receipts",
          "show_advanced": true,
          "stream": "nous",
          "allow_namespace_override": true,
          "folded": true,
          "recall_limit": 20,
          "op_timeout": 30
        }
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_act_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 1280, "y": 400 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "config": { "laneName": "result" },
      "input": [{ "lane": "answers", "from": "agent_act_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 1380, "y": 260 } }
    }
  ],
  "description": "Keep One Promise E2E: Sense(Laser+Falkor) → Plan(Calendar read+Critic) → Approve gate → Act(Book+Send) → Prove(dual receipts). 15 nodes, multi-agent.",
  "project_id": "e8f2a1c4-9d7b-5c3e-a6f0-1b2c3d4e5f60",
  "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "zoom": 0.75 },
  "version": 1
}
